      "refersTo": "option",
      "description": "A filter shows selection through ink fill and aria-pressed.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-option\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Under 2 hours</button>",
      "css": ".ds-option{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line-2,#a8bac7);border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:var(--text,#142e43);font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s,opacity .16s}.ds-option:hover{background:var(--surface-2,#e2e8ed)}.ds-option[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--ink,#102c43);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink,#102c43)}.ds-option:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-option:active{opacity:.78} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-option{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Main navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Five destinations: horizontal in the masthead, equal bottom destinations on mobile.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><button class=\"ds-nav-button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H15v-6h-6v6H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 19z\"/></svg><span>For you</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-button\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.25 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.9l-5.25 2.7 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><span>Rate</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-button\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"M15.5 15.5 20 20\"/></svg><span>Search</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-button\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h11v17L12 16.5l-5.5 4z\"/></svg><span>Library</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-button\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4.5 20c1.2-3.6 4.1-5.5 7.5-5.5s6.3 1.9 7.5 5.5\"/></svg><span>Your taste</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:16px;height:88px;background:var(--ink,#102c43);color:#b9cbd8}.ds-nav-button{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 12px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;border:0;background:transparent;font:550 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:color .16s,opacity .16s}.ds-nav-icon{width:19px;height:19px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-nav-button[aria-current=\"page\"],.ds-nav-button:hover{color:#fff}.ds-nav-button[aria-current=\"page\"]::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:19px;left:12px;right:12px;height:2px;background:var(--accent,#eac55c)}.ds-nav-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-nav-button:active{opacity:.78}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);height:65px;padding:5px 6px;gap:0}.ds-nav-button{padding:6px 0;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px}.ds-nav-icon{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-nav-button[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--accent-2,#f4d883)}.ds-nav-button[aria-current=\"page\"]::after{bottom:0;left:24px;right:24px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav,.ds-nav-button,.ds-nav-icon{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Film title frame",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "title-frame",
      "description": "The actual missing-art state demonstrates the frame without fabricating art or personal predictions.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-frame\"><button class=\"ds-frame-art\" aria-label=\"Open film\"><span class=\"ds-frame-fallback\">Artwork unavailable</span></button><div class=\"ds-frame-info\"><h2 class=\"ds-frame-title\"><button class=\"ds-frame-open\">A film for you</button></h2><p class=\"ds-frame-meta\">Film metadata</p><p class=\"ds-frame-reason\">Your recommendation explanation appears here.</p><button class=\"ds-frame-save\">Save to watchlist</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-frame{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:390px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;background:var(--ink,#102c43);color:#fff;font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-frame-art{align-self:start;border:0;padding:0;aspect-ratio:2/3;background:var(--ink-soft,#193b55);color:var(--muted,#526574);cursor:pointer}.ds-frame-fallback{color:#c3d3de;display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:100%;font:11px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-frame-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px}.ds-frame-title{font:550 34px/1.06 var(--display,Georgia,serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0}.ds-frame-open{text-align:left;border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-frame-meta{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#b9cedd;margin:14px 0 18px}.ds-frame-reason{margin:0;padding:17px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #3d586c;color:#c3d3de;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.ds-frame-save{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:5px;font:600 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s,opacity .16s;margin-top:22px;border:0;background:var(--accent,#eac55c);color:var(--ink,#102c43)}.ds-frame-save:hover{background:var(--accent-2,#f4d883)}.ds-frame-art:focus-visible,.ds-frame-open:focus-visible,.ds-frame-save:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-frame-art:active,.ds-frame-open:active,.ds-frame-save:active{opacity:.78}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-frame{grid-template-columns:110px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px 16px;padding:18px;min-height:0}.ds-frame-art{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/3}.ds-frame-info{display:contents}.ds-frame-title{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;font-size:26px;align-self:end}.ds-frame-meta{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;font-size:11px;margin:0}.ds-frame-reason{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:12px;padding-top:14px}.ds-frame-save{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start;margin-top:5px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-frame,.ds-frame-art,.ds-frame-fallback,.ds-frame-info,.ds-frame-meta,.ds-frame-open,.ds-frame-reason,.ds-frame-save,.ds-frame-title{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Poster tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "poster-tile",
      "description": "Real film art uses a 2:3 frame; this self-contained preview shows its missing-art state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-poster-tile\"><span class=\"ds-poster-fallback\">Artwork unavailable</span><span class=\"ds-poster-title\">Film title</span><span class=\"ds-poster-meta\">Year · Runtime</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-poster-tile{width:160px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;text-align:left;color:var(--text,#142e43);font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .16s}.ds-poster-fallback{display:grid;place-items:center;aspect-ratio:2/3;width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--surface-2,#e2e8ed);color:var(--muted,#526574);font-size:11px;text-align:center}.ds-poster-title{display:block;margin-top:11px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600}.ds-poster-meta{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#526574)}.ds-poster-tile:hover .ds-poster-title{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-poster-tile:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-poster-tile:active{opacity:.78}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-poster-tile{width:132px}.ds-poster-title{font-size:13px}.ds-poster-meta{font-size:11px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-poster-fallback,.ds-poster-meta,.ds-poster-tile,.ds-poster-title{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rating action row",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "rating-control",
      "description": "Six original actions retain visible labels, distinct SVG icons, opinion colors, and their responsive grid.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-rating-row\"><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6\"/></svg><span>Not seen</span></button><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:#8a6818\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h11v17L12 16.5l-5.5 4z\"/></svg><span>Save</span></button><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--nope,#a64136)\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg><span>Nope</span></button><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--meh,#586a79)\"><path d=\"M6 12h12\"/></svg><span>OK</span></button><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--like,#24714f)\"><path d=\"M12 20s-7.5-4.6-7.5-10A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 7.2 4.5 4.5 0 0 1 19.5 10c0 5.4-7.5 10-7.5 10z\"/></svg><span>Liked</span></button><button class=\"ds-rating\"><svg class=\"ds-rating-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--love,#a54461)\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.25 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.9l-5.25 2.7 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><span>Loved</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-rating-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.ds-rating{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:70px;padding:8px 1px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d2dce3);border-radius:5px;background:var(--surface,#f9fafb);color:var(--text,#142e43);font:11px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s,opacity .16s}.ds-rating-icon{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-rating:hover{background:var(--surface-2,#e2e8ed);border-color:var(--line-2,#a8bac7)}.ds-rating:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-rating:active{opacity:.78}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-rating{min-height:63px;gap:7px}.ds-rating-icon{width:22px;height:22px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-rating,.ds-rating-icon{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-rating-row{gap:5px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Protected dialog",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "dialog",
      "description": "Solid sheet surface and close control; runtime focus trapping belongs to the app.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Rate this film\"><button class=\"ds-dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"><svg class=\"ds-dialog-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button><h3 class=\"ds-dialog-title\">Rate this film</h3><p class=\"ds-dialog-sub\">Your opinion helps shape your next picks.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:590px;max-height:90dvh;overflow-y:auto;background:var(--bg,#edf1f3);color:var(--text,#142e43);padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px #00000044;font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-dialog-title{font:550 30px/1.2 var(--display,Georgia,serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 40px 12px 0}.ds-dialog-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#526574);margin:0 0 22px}.ds-dialog-close{position:absolute;right:13px;top:13px;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#526574);cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,opacity .16s}.ds-dialog-icon{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-dialog-close:hover{background:var(--surface-2,#e2e8ed)}.ds-dialog-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #337ab0;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:3px;}.ds-dialog-close:active{opacity:.78}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-dialog{max-height:92dvh;padding:27px 20px calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));border-radius:12px 12px 0 0}.ds-dialog-title{font-size:28px}.ds-dialog-sub{font-size:13px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-dialog,.ds-dialog-close,.ds-dialog-icon,.ds-dialog-sub,.ds-dialog-title{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Title sequence",
    "overview": "Kael takes its visual character from a film title sequence: custom KAEL lettering, ink blue frames, a single gold emphasis, expressive film titles, and real film artwork. Cool pale working surfaces give ratings, metadata, search, and personal history room to remain legible. The identity belongs to the films and the viewer’s relationship to them.\n\nFraunces is the existing locally hosted display family, deliberately retained with its SIL Open Font License. System sans-serif handles controls and factual detail. Recommendations pair a film with the actual explanation produced from the viewer’s ratings; visual framing must never imply a fabricated critic’s verdict.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A geometric KAEL wordmark and split K identify the app; real film art and serif titles identify its content.",
      "Ink blue frames and gold actions provide hierarchy.",
      "Open sections, thin rules, and compact metadata support repeated work.",
      "Touch, keyboard, and reduced-motion behavior are part of the component contract."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Film and Reason Rule",
        "body": "Present the film title, artwork, and model-derived reason as related information. Preserve readable titles while artwork loads or is unavailable.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Gold Emphasis Rule",
        "body": "Use gold for the primary action on an ink surface, the active navigation marker, match emphasis, and selected artwork markers. Keep ordinary working-surface buttons ink blue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Title and Task Rule",
        "body": "Use Fraunces for film titles and editorial headings; use the system sans-serif for controls, dates, counts, and supporting metadata. Keep the locally hosted font and its license together.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use tonal separation and thin rules for ordinary sections. Reserve shadows for floating feedback, protected dialogs, and selected poster presentations.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Mark Rule",
        "body": "Use the custom KAEL paths from web/brand.js: gold split K and cream AEL on navy, without font reconstruction, gradients, glows, or shadows. Preserve the aspect ratio, 118px desktop / 100px mobile / 216px loading widths, install-icon safe circle, and separate optical favicon size. Generate SVG/PNG assets with scripts/brand-assets.mjs and draw the same paths on the taste-card canvas.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do pair real film artwork with readable titles and actual recommendation explanations.",
      "Do reuse the ink, accent, surface, and status tokens rather than introduce a new decorative palette.",
      "Do preserve 2:3 poster frames in shelves, grids, and the featured recommendation; apply the explicit mobile rating exception only in the rating stage.",
      "Do retain visible keyboard focus, semantic selected states, protected dialog focus, and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do make new standalone controls at least 44px high and icon controls at least 44px by 44px.",
      "Do use open sections and rules for settings and personal history.",
      "Do generate logo assets from web/brand.js and preserve the split K, aspect ratio, and icon safe area."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t invent reviews, critic endorsements, user statistics, or model explanations to fill the layout.",
      "Don’t replace the locally hosted Fraunces title face with a system display face.",
      "Don’t turn every section into a rounded, shadowed card.",
      "Don’t remove visible text labels or rely on rating color alone.",
      "Don’t infer a universal ban on gradients: the mobile rating caption and film-detail still use protective image shading.",
      "Don’t propagate documented target-size exceptions as new component defaults.",
      "Don’t recreate KAEL with a font, close the K’s open joins, or add gradients or shadows to the logo."
    ]
  }
}
